  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> Seven Tools. One Contour. </h1>",
   "body": "<p>A set of seven shaping tools, ranging from coarse grinding to polishing, is used to process a workpiece – designed for marble, granite, natural stone, synthetic materials, and agglomerates. The seven tools and their contours are recorded and measured with high precision using ZOLLER »conDiaZ«. They are then intelligently compared with each other in »pilot 4.0« and optimally coordinated so that the tools and correction data are perfectly prepared for the CNC machine and the workpiece is manufactured to the highest quality right from the start. This protects both the tools and the CNC machine in the long term.</p> <h4>Advantages of »conDiaZ« contour detection</h4><ul><li>Fully automatic inspection of all contours</li><li>Optimal tool preparation for the machine</li><li>No reworking, no adjustment runs</li></ul>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/7/csm_Sieben_Werkzeuge_Eine_Kontur_EN_8a3eef61c5.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1469,
     "h": 925
    }
   ],
