  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "50-50",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h2> Record, Compare, Finished – ZOLLER »lasso« </h2>",
      "body": "<p>The »lasso« function allows users to capture tool data more intuitively and efficiently than ever before. After measurement, the complete actual contour appears on the »lasso« screen and can be precisely positioned there—for exact determination of the tool center and perfect alignment with the material.</p> <p>By simply outlining the relevant area, all important information is automatically recognized, intelligently grouped, and directly transferred to the process. This not only reduces clicks and potential operating errors, but also noticeably speeds up tool data acquisition—for a significantly smoother, faster, and reliably stable workflow during setup and maintenance.</p> <h4>Advantages of the »lasso« function</h4><ul><li>Thousands of measuring points in seconds – freely selectable 0 to 360°</li><li>Nominal/actual comparison with tolerances and variable superelevation</li><li>Specialized functions for stoneworking tools</li></ul>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
