  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Precision That Saves Setup Times – »pilot 4.0« </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The ZOLLER software »pilot 4.0« makes measuring seven tool sets efficient. All tools are recorded one after the other in a single process, the contours are automatically compared, and deviations are displayed. The measurement and correction values are optimized in relation to each other and transferred directly to the CNC control – without the need for readjustment. This ensures that the entire tool set fits together perfectly, significantly reducing both setup time and machine downtime.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/2/csm_pilot40_c007ab3aea.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1469,
     "h": 925
