  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Smart cabinets for diamond tools </h2>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER Smart Cabinets enable a secure, clear and digital management process for diamond coated tools that are used in the stone industry. Each disc is clearly assigned, can be found immediately, and is protected from damage. Stock is automatically visible, and mix-ups are impossible enabling a fast tool setup process and complete process reliability.</p> <p>More about ZOLLER Smart Cabinets</p>",
